      "id": "daily-warmup",
      "name": "Daily 12-minute warm-up",
      "region": "Practice resource",
      "summary": "A short sequence you can repeat before repertoire.",
      "intro": "Use this as a default warm-up when you have little time.\n\n1) Easy sirens\n2) Lip trills on five-note patterns\n3) One comfortable song phrase at half voice\n\nStop if the throat feels scratchy — switch to hums and hydration.",
