      "id": "voice-care",
      "name": "Voice care week",
      "region": "Health resource",
      "summary": "Hydration, rest, and when to stop singing.",
      "intro": "Voice care is boring until you need it.\n\nHydrate early in the day, not only mid-rehearsal. Sleep beats another late run-through when the voice is tired.\n\nPain, persistent hoarseness, or sudden range loss means rest and, if needed, a professional — not more pushing.",
